---
import DocsLayout from '../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
---
<DocsLayout title="Examples" description="See poddle in action: run an agent headless, or spin a pod up and tear it down.">
  <div class="doc-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">Docs · Examples</p>
    <h1 class="doc-title">See it work.</h1>
    <p class="doc-lead">Representative sessions. The commands, flags, and output formats are real; the run narration is illustrative.</p>
  </div>

  <section class="doc-block" style="margin-top:1.8rem">
    <h2>Run an agent headless</h2>
    <p class="doc-p">Give <code>poddle task</code> a prompt and it runs a coding agent to completion in a throwaway pod - the broker injects credentials on the wire, never into the pod.</p>
    <div class="term">
      <div class="term__bar"><span class="term__glyph">&gt;_</span><span class="term__title">zsh</span></div>
      <pre class="term__body"><code><span class="cmd">poddle task "port the auth module to the new API" --identity work --size strong</span>
<span class="out">→ pod poddle-task-4c71 up (strong) · broker attached</span>
<span class="out">→ claude-code · turn 12/24 · 7 files changed</span>
<span class="ok">✓ done in 3m41s · pod torn down</span></code></pre>
    </div>
    <p class="doc-note">Add <code>--detach</code> to leave it running in the background, then follow along with <code>poddle logs</code>.</p>

    <h2 style="margin-top:2.2rem">Spin up, inspect, tear down</h2>
    <div class="term">
      <div class="term__bar"><span class="term__glyph">&gt;_</span><span class="term__title">zsh</span></div>
      <pre class="term__body"><code><span class="cmd">poddle up api --identity work --detach</span>
<span class="out">a1b2c3d4e5f6</span>
<span class="cmd">poddle ls</span>
<span class="out">ID            NAME  TEMPLATE  SIZE  STATE    REPO</span>
<span class="out">a1b2c3d4e5f6  api   base      weak  running  -</span>
<span class="cmd">poddle down api</span></code></pre>
    </div>
    <h2 style="margin-top:2.2rem">Run against a remote host</h2>
    <p class="doc-p">Point <code>PODDLE_HOST</code> at an SSH target and every command runs there - same flags, remote pods.</p>
    <div class="term">
      <div class="term__bar"><span class="term__glyph">&gt;_</span><span class="term__title">zsh</span></div>
      <pre class="term__body"><code><span class="cmd">export PODDLE_HOST=ssh://build@10.0.0.5</span>
<span class="cmd">poddle up big --identity work --size strong</span>
<span class="out">→ big up (strong) on build@10.0.0.5 · broker attached</span></code></pre>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="doc-more">
    <a href="/docs">← Get started</a>
    <a href="/docs/connectors">Connectors →</a>
    <a href="/docs/templates">Templates →</a>
    <a href="/docs/commands">Command reference →</a>
  </div>
</DocsLayout>
